      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Random Joke (Promise Chain)</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header>\n    <h1>Random Joke Generator</h1>\n    <p>Click the button to load a joke from the Official Joke API.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <button id=\"btn\">Get a joke</button>\n    <p id=\"status\">Status: ready</p>\n\n    <section class=\"card\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <h2>Joke</h2>\n      <p id=\"setup\">(setup will appear here)</p>\n      <p id=\"punchline\">(punchline will appear here)</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "body {\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\n  margin: 24px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\nbutton {\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  margin-top: 16px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  border: 1px solid #ddd;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  max-width: 650px;\n}\n#status {\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "const btn = document.querySelector(\"#btn\");\nconst statusEl = document.querySelector(\"#status\");\nconst setupEl = document.querySelector(\"#setup\");\nconst punchlineEl = document.querySelector(\"#punchline\");\n\nbtn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n  statusEl.textContent = \"Status: loading...\";\n\n  fetch(\"https://official-joke-api.appspot.com/random_joke\")\n    .then(function (response) {\n      return response.json();\n    })\n    .then(function (data) {\n      setupEl.textContent = data.setup;\n      punchlineEl.textContent = data.punchline;\n      statusEl.textContent = \"Status: done\";\n    });\n});",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "original_script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "const btn = document.querySelector(\"#btn\");\nconst statusEl = document.querySelector(\"#status\");\nconst setupEl = document.querySelector(\"#setup\");\nconst punchlineEl = document.querySelector(\"#punchline\");\n\nbtn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n  statusEl.textContent = \"Status: loading...\";\n\n  fetch(\"https://official-joke-api.appspot.com/random_joke\")\n    .then(function (response) {\n      return response.json();\n    })\n    .then(function (data) {\n      setupEl.textContent = data.setup;\n      punchlineEl.textContent = data.punchline;\n      statusEl.textContent = \"Status: done\";\n    });\n});",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "3",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Refactor the Code\r\n\r\nThis `.then()` promise chain loads a joke from the [Random Joke API](https://official-joke-api.appspot.com/random_joke) but the code is hard to read.\r\n\r\nYour task is to refactor the code in `script.js` using `async` and `await`.\r\n\r\n:::details [Not sure where to start?]\r\n1) Create an async function `getJoke()`.\r\n2) Move the `fetch(...)` code inside `getJoke()` and rewrite it using:\r\n   - `await fetch(url)`\r\n   - `await response.json()`\r\n3) Update the button click handler so it calls `getJoke()`. \r\n4) Check that clicking “Get a joke” displays a setup and punchline.\r\n:::\r\n\r\nOnce you have working code, use AI Tutor to generate a refactored version of the original code. \r\n\r\n*Hint: Prompt AI Tutor to refactor `original_script.js` which contains the original `.then()` chain.*\r\n\r\n**Discuss:** What differences do you notice between the manually refactored code and AI refactored code? Which version do you prefer to use? ",
